      "widgets_values": [
        "Make a picture and send it to Resolve\n=====================================\nA plain text-to-image graph whose result goes into your media pool. Swap Krea 2\nfor any model \u2014 only the last node is ours.\n\nTurn 'send automatically' off to audition the picture first, then press\n'Send to Resolve' when you like it."
