      "widgets_values": [
        "Models needed \u2014 Krea 2\n----------------------\nAll from  https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2\n\ndiffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors    ~12.9 GB\ntext_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\nvae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n\nWhere they go\n-------------\nComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/   ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/   ComfyUI/models/vae/\n\nShort of VRAM? The int4 build is half the size and just as fast \u2014 convrot\nquantisation is never emulated, unlike fp4 or fp8:\n  https://huggingface.co/Winnougan/INT4-Convrot-Comfy-Models\n  -> krea2_turbo-int4_convrot.safetensors  (~6.9 GB)\n"
